{
  "title": "Oozy Smoky Ukrainian Shrimp Stew",
  "description": "A smoky and gooey one-pot Ukrainian dish featuring shrimp, paste, and miso marinade, low in calories and rich in flavor.",
  "cuisine": "Ukrainian",
